cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "mcp-sploit: A Metasploit-style exploitation framework for the Model Context Protocol"
abstract: >
  An interactive, msfconsole-style framework for security-testing Model
  Context Protocol (MCP) servers and MCP security gateways. Includes modules
  for unauthenticated tool execution, file exfiltration, indirect prompt
  injection (tool response poisoning), tool schema/type-confusion abuse, and
  gateway policy fingerprinting, plus an intentionally vulnerable sandbox
  server for reproducible testing.
authors:
